#: ../../source/docs/analysis/playback.rst:3 3afd96ade8bd48ee92d466f957260c24
msgid "Playback"
msgstr "回放"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/playback.rst:5 b46ebbd7a4e848158a7b78e0c8d68162
msgid ""
"The logfiles (\\*.tlog) generated by MAVProxy (or other ground station "
"programs) during flight can be played back through MAVProxy. This is done "
"via streaming the logfile through a local port and connecting MAVProxy to "
"that port."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy（或其他地面站程序）在飞行期间生成的日志文件（\\*.tlog）可通过 MAVProxy "
"进行回放。具体方法是将日志文件通过本地端口流式传输，并将 MAVProxy 连接到该端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/playback.rst:10 7313073364f345919f42b3ef9659d0cf
msgid ""
"Any commands that propagate up to the UAV will not function during playback "
"mode."
msgstr "在回放模式下，任何传播到无人机的命令均不会生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/playback.rst:17 a394ddb7ff434c189933d4f5a80ac93f
msgid ""
"This will stream MAVLink over ``127.0.0.1:14550``. Thus MAVProxy can be "
"connected to it via:"
msgstr "这将通过 ``127.0.0.1:14550`` 流式传输 MAVLink。因此，MAVProxy 可通过以下方式连接到它："

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/playback.rst:24 10dbc560b84646bab2a09dd998bed341
msgid ""
"The playback program will have a small GUI to pause, fast forward and slow "
"down the playback speed."
msgstr "回放程序将提供一个小型图形界面，用于暂停、快进和减慢回放速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/playback.rst:27 9e6db53fc8ad41efab49c2e0ee74f707
msgid ""
"The output IP address and port can be overridden via the ``--out`` "
"commandline argument:"
msgstr "输出 IP 地址和端口可通过 ``--out`` 命令行参数覆盖："
